+| `frame-legs/` | `frame-leg.step`, `.stl`, `.dxf` (the profile, 4 off), `frame-legs-4.step` (all four in place), `leg-locator.step`/`.stl`, `wedge.step`/`.stl` (printed) | `v2/cad/frame_leg.py` |
