+with the CAD set of `v2/cad/requirements-cad.lock` (build123d 0.13.0, cadquery-ocp-novtk 8.0.1.0.0, ezdxf 1.4.4, matplotlib 3.11.2, numpy
+2.5.3, reportlab 5.0.1). The branch started at `e3aedb25`; every case input outside the branch (the seven board files, `frame_seat.out`,
+`CASE-MARGINS.md`, Peli's files) is byte-identical at `e3aedb25` and `84e52461`. The inputs, sha256 first 16:
